Z||000000||fierojunky||02-01-2001||11:16 AM||||i have an 87 SE does anyone know what wheels should have came on that car?  it has the 14in and it seems that most have 15?<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Oreif||02-01-2001||11:46 AM||||The SE's came with 14 X 6 aluminum wheels. Only the 86 thru 88 GT's and the 88 Formula's had the 15 X 7 wheels. Many folks get aftermarket wheels in 15 or larger. I have a set of 86 GT wheels on my 86 SE.<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 02-01-2001).]||||reg||1
